      "message": "The cache can only be filled via atm\n```\nval downloadRequest \u003d DownloadRequest.Builder(contentId, contentUri).build()\nDownloadService.sendAddDownload(\n  context,\n  TwelveDownloadService::class.java,\n  downloadRequest,\n  /* foreground\u003d */ false\n)```\n\nThe Player sees the cache as read-only, so it won\u0027t ever fill it by itself, this can be changed by removing `.setCacheWriteDataSinkFactory(null)`.\n\nIf we do that we also have to switch DownloadManager to the CacheDataSource otherwise it\u0027ll bypass it and re-download it.\n\nCurrent setup\nPlayback -\u003e Uses cache data source -\u003e no hit download\nDownload -\u003e Bypasses cache data source -\u003e",
